Graffiti.pc Conjecture 141 proof and formalization
Copyright 2026 Jun Qing

This product includes definitions and generic induced-tree lemmas adapted from
the Formal Conjectures project and pull request #4454:

  https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures
  https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures/pull/4454

Those portions are Copyright 2025 The Formal Conjectures Authors and are used
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. In particular, the definitions
`largestInducedTreeSize` and `indepNeighborsCard`, and the generic infrastructure
for attaching a uniquely adjacent leaf, shortest-path induced trees, and
induced stars, were adapted from that work.

The breadth-first spanning-tree construction, the root-distance/girth lemma,
the induced-star plus geodesic extension, and the final Conjecture 141 proof in
this repository implement Jun Qing's written argument.
